# Global Rules
Output unified diffs only, no entire file rewrites. Zero conversational preamble.

# Python Guidelines
Enforce PEP8 strictly.
Mandate that all test commands use `pytest -q`.
Linter execution: `ruff check --quiet`.

# JS/TS Guidelines
Enforce strict functional component boundaries.
Quiet test execution: `npm test -- --silent` or equivalent quiet execution.
Linter execution: `eslint --quiet`.
